      {
        "name": "Chainsaw Grind",
        "slug": "chainsaw-grind",
        "description": "<p>Effect: On hit, the target has a 30% chance of gaining @Affliction[bleed 2], a 20% of losing -1 DEF Stage for 2 Activations, and a 10% chance of gaining @Affliction[splinter 2]. Each consecutive time this attack hits the same target, this attack's Flat Damage increases by +3, Accuracy by +5, Priority by +15, and the user’s EHR for this Attack increases by +35%.</p><p>This progress is tracked via the 6 Span Chainsaw Grind Clock, which is reset to 0 if this Attack misses or this Attack is not used during the user’s Activation).</p>",
